[7.006658, "o", "\u001b[93m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[93m────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[93m \u001b[0m\u001b[93mABOUT\u001b[0m\u001b[93m \u001b[0m\u001b[93m─────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[93m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;93m✦ lantern\u001b[0m\u001b[90m  v0.1.0\u001b[0m                                                        \u001b[93m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m│\u001b[0m \u001b[37mA fully-local AI agent. Everything runs against your own\u001b[0m                 \u001b[93m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m│\u001b[0m \u001b[37mOllama — no account, no cloud, nothing leaves your machine.\u001b[0m              \u001b[93m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m│\u001b[0m                                                                          \u001b[93m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;93m  ● remembers\u001b[0m\u001b[90m — past chats + facts about you, recalled semantically\u001b[0m      \u001b[93m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;93m  ● uses your PC\u001b[0m\u001b[90m — shell, files, system stats — behind a safety gate\u001b[0m     \u001b[93m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;93m  ● searches the web\u001b[0m\u001b[90m — end a chat message with /web for live, cited \u001b[0m     \u001b[93m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m│\u001b[0m \u001b[90manswers\u001b[0m                                                                  \u001b[93m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;93m  ● stays yours\u001b[0m\u001b[90m — one local SQLite file; delete it and it's gone\u001b[0m         \u001b[93m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m│\u001b[0m                                                                          \u001b[93m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;91mTip: \u001b[0m\u001b[90mtype /web after a question in chat to search the internet.\u001b[0m          \u001b[93m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
